{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__web-components#card-zh","repo":"omdsh-dev/web-components","commit":"6d6f77aaf881a78b45c6ec6593b9db8788abcef4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-web-component 是 DSH Web 插件：将注册的 slot 树挂载为原生 Custom Elements。webComponent 服务读取 slots，将 root slot 装入 Element 或 ShadowRoot，并支持属性、事件和子 outlet 绑定。它按 slot 与会话状态选择条目、转发 CustomEvent、清理挂载树，并为失败条目显示诊断元素。适合已有兼容 DSH Web runtime、希望用原生元素构建界面的 profile；bundle 行默认禁用，启用前需提供浏览器 DOM 与 slots 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:5-8","src/client/index.ts:11-20","src/client/service.ts:64-81","src/client/mount.ts:172-205"]}
